{"id":"afa5f963c264afee","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-yang-mills.md","title":"Yang-Mills","display":"df-yang-mills — Yang-Mills","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-yang-mills","aliases":["58-df-yang-mills"],"display":"df-yang-mills — Yang-Mills","depends_on":["[[58-df-connection]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-yang-mills"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-yang-mills</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-yang-mills — Yang-Mills"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904b0609d7cbf868\" href=\"?note=904b0609d7cbf868\" title=\"58-df-connection\">58-df-connection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,g)\">\\((M,g)\\)</span> (Riemannian manifold) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:E\\to M\">\\(\\pi:E\\to M\\)</span> (metric vector bundle over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (compatible connection), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_A\\in\\Omega^2(M,\\operatorname{End}E)\">\\(F_A\\in\\Omega^2(M,\\operatorname{End}E)\\)</span> (curvature), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_A^*\">\\(d_A^*\\)</span> (formal adjoint)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S,\\mathrm{Connection}_S,\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S,\\mathrm{Connection}_S,\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S,\\mathrm{YangMills}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S,\\mathrm{YangMills}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S(e,A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land e=\\frac12\\int_M\\|F_A\\|_g^2\\,d\\operatorname{vol}_g\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S(e,A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land e=\\frac12\\int_M\\|F_A\\|_g^2\\,d\\operatorname{vol}_g\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMills}_S(A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land d_A^*F_A=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMills}_S(A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land d_A^*F_A=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Euler--Lagrange equation is meaningful only after the bundle, metric, compatible connection, and its curvature have been fixed.</li>\n<li>The projection and scalar field now agree with the upstream connection and curvature predicates instead of calling obsolete three- and four-place forms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-connection","status":"resolved","id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-connection]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi:E\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F_A\\in\\Omega^2(M,\\operatorname{End}E)","display":false},{"tex":"d_A^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S,\\mathrm{Connection}_S,\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S,\\mathrm{YangMills}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMillsEnergy}_S(e,A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land e=\\frac12\\int_M\\|F_A\\|_g^2\\,d\\operatorname{vol}_g","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yang\\text{-}mills} \\vdash \\mathrm{YangMills}_S(A,F_A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k,g)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\\mathrm{Connection}_S(A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureOfConnection}_S(F_A,A,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb k)\\land d_A^*F_A=0","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-yang-mills.md|58-df-yang-mills]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["904b0609d7cbf868","04b9f5c6479b7ecd"]}